<p>You recall the age long gone where necromancers had free reign over the world.</p><p>Increases all saves by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 25, 36, 46, 55,</acronym> confusion and teleport resistances by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">16%, 26%, 34%, 39%, 44%.</acronym></p><p>At level 5 any time you cross the 1 life threshold you become invulnerable for 1 turns.</p>